            "text": "<div class=\"layer-visualizer-switch\" ng-if=\"insulfilmSwitchHandler.forChassis\"\n     ng-class=\"{'below-edition-actions': editionSectionOpen || editionSectionOpenUGD}\"\n     role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"layer-visualizer-switch-title\">\n  <p id=\"layer-visualizer-switch-title\" class=\"layer-visualizer-switch-title\">Tipo de visualizador de camadas</p>\n  <div class=\"layer-visualizer-switch-options\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"layer-visualizer-switch-option\"\n            ng-class=\"{'selected': layerVisualizerMode === layerVisualizerModes.CATEGORICAL}\"\n            aria-pressed=\"{{ layerVisualizerMode === layerVisualizerModes.CATEGORICAL }}\"\n            ng-click=\"showCategoricalTimeLine()\">Categórico</button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"layer-visualizer-switch-option\"\n            ng-class=\"{'selected': layerVisualizerMode === layerVisualizerModes.OVERLAP}\"\n            aria-pressed=\"{{ layerVisualizerMode === layerVisualizerModes.OVERLAP }}\"\n            ng-click=\"showOverlappingTimeLine()\">Sobreposição</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
